cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "dtlog: Logging for 'data.table' Operations"
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-22

authors:
  - family-names: "Shiroshita"
    given-names: "Akihiro"
    email: "akihirokun8@gmail.com"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0003-0262-459X"

repository-code: "https://github.com/AkiShiroshita/dtlog"
url: "https://akishiroshita.github.io/dtlog/"
license: "MIT"
keywords:
  - R
  - data.table
  - logging
  - reproducibility

abstract: >
  An R package that prints a short message describing what each 'data.table'
  operation did: how many rows a filter removed, which columns were added,
  updated or dropped, how many groups an aggregation produced, and how a join
  matched. The operations themselves are left untouched, including
  modification by reference.
